    "implementation_delta": "Add ModelProviderExecution@1. Run a live local OpenAI-compatible canary covering identity, load, inference, output validation, cancellation, timeout, cleanup, fail-closed resource admission, and repetition. Qualify one live llama.cpp local LLM path (leanstral_local) when present. HardwareKit._test_model_provider uses that canary. The hardware ladder exposes from_live_model_provider_execution without granting production_authorized or the release-grade qualified rung. Torch, transformers, and HuggingFace Hub downloads are not qualification. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
